WEBVTT

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.490
So...

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:41.920
Joestar-san...

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.230
you don't know where Jotaro is right now?

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.130
I can't feel his presence at all.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:47.800
I'm hoping Polnareff and Iggi are safe...

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.610
So, do you think...?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.510
Even if we're the only ones standing...

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:55.080
we must defeat Dio.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:57.950
Kakyoin...

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.280
how are your eyes?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.750
Yes, I'm alright now.

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:03.950
I'm sorry to have troubled you...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:04.520
but...

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:07.950
now I am able to fight Dio
with 100% of my power.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.930
Be very wary, Kakyoin.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.930
Even Avdol was taken out in blink of an eye.

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.800
Although we encountered
Dio's Stand, 'The World'...

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.900
we weren't able to see its ability at all!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.970
There has to be something...

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:26.580
A way to fight back against Dio!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.680
Dio is after us. No...

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:31.920
He will come after my
Joestar blood for sure!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.010
He plans to finish us before sunrise!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.850
By then, there has to be a chance
to find the secret to his Stand!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.790
That's when we must attack Dio together.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.210
Automobiles.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.220
Such power and speed.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:41.220
Back when I, Dio, was born, there
were only horse carriages around.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.710
This is terrible!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.370
This car...does it still work?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.610
W..Who the hell are you!?

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.080
Y...You...

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.580
d...didn't get hurt!?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.450
This car...is it still working? I'm asking you.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.320
Hey, hold on!

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.820
If you're not hurt, just get lost!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:21.460
Don't you go around touching it like that.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.590
Who do you think this car belongs to!?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.200
Or, maybe you...

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.900
bumped into it on purpose,
knowing that it's the Senator's car?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.390
Young people seem to act on
their impulses all too easily.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:49.120
Well, well, I apologize
for my driver's behavior.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.600
I hope you didn't get hurt?

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.190
Start the car.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:58.000
You knocked out my driver.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.000
If you are in a hurry...

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.600
I don't mean to offend you...

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.610
but please take this, and
if you could catch a taxi...

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:08.940
Drive.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.550
W-w-what do you think you're doing!?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.420
Who do you think I am!?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.320
It's the small red truck.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.860
Drive until you catch up.

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.190
D-don't you think you
can get away with this!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.100
I'm a Senator from the
United States of America!

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.170
To treat me like this means...

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.440
If you can't catch up...

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.540
I will kill you.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.640
Y...Y-you're insane!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.340
I-I'll execute you!

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.720
I'll have you executed for this!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.350
H...He...Help me!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.300
W-what the...!?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.240
Hurry up and start the car.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.770
Somebody, Hel...Help me...!

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:16.180
Hurry up...

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.980
while you're still alive.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.890
Broke a few.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.170
But, I'm lucky enough to be alive.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:43.370
I have no idea how I managed
to survive Dio's attack.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.310
What is it...

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.680
that Stand of his?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.290
I've heard the tarot card
representing him is 'The World.'

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.260
Back then I wasn't able
to see his Stand at all.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:58.120
But...

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.030
I figured something out...

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:00.760
Dio!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.210
I hate to admit it, but...

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:15.810
your Stand has power and speed
equivalent to my Star Platinum.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.650
Although, there has to
be something more...

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.880
a secret beyond imagination.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:26.580
He's far more intimidating than any
Stand users I've met in the past.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.800
No wonder N'Dool and Iced
pledged their loyalty to him.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.500
You're fit to be my opponent...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.370
Dio!

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:42.670
Hurry up and go.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:47.640
I-if you could take a look around,
I'm sure you'll understand...

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.620
The traffic is very bad,
and it is not moving at all!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.020
There's space on the sidewalk.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.180
R-r-r-r-r...

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:56.220
Ridiculous!

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.150
That's insane!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.720
What about my reputation!?

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.300
There's a lot of people there!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.020
It doesn't matter.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:06.760
Go.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.540
Go faster.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.950
Y-yessir!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.140
More.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.850
Yessir!

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.820
Stop! Stop!

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.700
Please don't make me do this any more!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.830
No.

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:46.670
Here he comes, Kakyoin.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:47.900
Dio!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:52.640
The dark atmosphere he
emits is closing in on us!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:53.870
Where is he?

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.080
From strange vibes in the
Joestar blood we share...

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.850
I can feel his presence.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.490
I know he's nearby, but I
cannot tell his exact location.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.760
But then, the same goes for him!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:05.520
Kakyoin!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.220
Be aware of your surroundings!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.700
If we fight him here...

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.170
we'll involve the innocent people of the city!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:17.570
What is it?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.280
There seems to be a disturbance.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.350
Wha...!?

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:31.180
Dio!

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.510
A red truck! A red truck!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.840
That's it, isn't it!?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.110
I won't let it get away!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.320
Get closer. Much closer.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.450
The game is over, Joseph.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.820
Kakyoin's Hierophant!

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:23.430
He got away from the Emerald
Splash at such close range...?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.200
In that case...!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:40.920
Shit! It didn't even graze him!

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.290
I'll try to concentrate it more!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:43.830
Don't get too close.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.660
Kakyoin...

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:49.460
Retreat!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.470
He's not the kind of enemy we
can fight without a strategy!

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.470
Let's lose him for now!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:53.870
But, Joestar-san!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.480
We don't have any clues yet!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.170
Not good!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.370
Kakyoin...back off! Retreat!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.450
Kakyoin! Behind you!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:10.160
Eh!?

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.840
Now, we bought ourselves some
time to work on our strategy.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.780
How are they? Your injuries?

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.250
I'm sorry.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.980
I totally lost control of myself...

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.160
But...

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.750
there are some things I figured out.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:17.820
About Dio...?

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.390
'The World...'

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.900
is similar to Jotaro's Star Platinum.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.370
It doesn't seem to possess
any projectile weapons...

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.840
and it can't reach out too far.

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.700
I think that would work to our advantage!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:31.070
But, the question is...

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.910
why is it we're always beaten before
we even realize what's going on...?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.640
For us not to feel his
presence when he appears...

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.980
Suddenly appearing...

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.620
What kind of secret could it be!?

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.920
Is it possible that he...

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:46.750
possesses a power of
teleportation of some kind?

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.590
If so, that would explain
how he appears out of no...

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.390
Kakyoin.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:50.920
It isn't like you.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.660
Drawing hasty conclusions
may cost you your life.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:57.820
One can never be too cautious
in dealing with this guy.

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.090
What the...?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.230
Kakyoin!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.310
Dio...!

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.890
How can he involve the
innocent people of the city?

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.050
What is it...

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.060
Kakyoin?

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.760
I have an idea...

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.800
to reveal the true nature of Dio's Stand!

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:00.450
Useless.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.100
I don't see Kakyoin around.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:18.040
Are they thinking of
attacking me from two sides?

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.620
Damn, it's Kakyoin's Hierophant!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.730
It's Hierophant's barrier!

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.620
How clever of you!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.670
This is...

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.420
How is it, Dio...

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:03.450
my barrier?

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:07.580
The Hierophant's barrier is made
to shoot when it is touched...

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:09.920
and is surrounding you in
the radius of twenty meters!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:11.420
Your movement...

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.900
'The World's' movement...

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.400
I can detect every movement of both!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.130
We've got you now, Dio.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.970
Show it to us...

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:21.800
the secret of 'The World!'

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.370
Kakyoin...

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.780
your first name is Noriaki, isn't it?

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.350
How old are you now?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.210
What?

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.750
Don't hasten to your death,
is what I'm trying to tell you.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.050
You don't seem to understand
the position you're in...

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:41.680
Dio.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.160
No matter what kind of power
'The World' possesses...

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:47.670
you cannot move, not
even an inch, from there!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.630
I wonder about that.

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.600
Try me.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:56.980
Are you frightened, Kakyoin?

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:59.540
Just like a year ago.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:00.810
Ridiculous!

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:02.980
Yes, it's true when I met you that time...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.610
I gave into the nauseating fear!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.020
But that's not the case now!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.210
Kakyoin...

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.990
you are a prudent, excellent Stand user.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:15.620
Brimming with youth and passion...such
qualities are irreplaceable.

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:18.130
Protecting and sacrificing your
life for an old man like Joseph...

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.460
what worth do you see in it?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.800
The reason why I've been fighting
is not only for Jotaro and...

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.460
Joestar-san, who saved me!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.040
To regain my honor from the
indignity I suffered from you...

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.910
I've been fighting for myself!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:33.140
It is not too late yet. Pledge
eternal loyalty to me.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:34.680
Here's my answer!

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:35.680
Take this, Dio!

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.420
You fool!

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:47.430
Let it be known!

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:51.500
The power of 'The World' is truly
the power to rule this world!

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.200
The...

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.860
World!

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.430
This is 'The World.'

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:23.630
Although...

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:28.800
in the stillness of time, you are not
able to see nor feel anything at all.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.800
Die, Kakyoin!

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:44.280
You don't even know you're dead yet.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.420
There's no way for you to
know what has happened.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.720
You're next.

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.670
I-it can't be!!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.640
Kakyoin!

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.480
Finally, you're the last one, Joseph.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.410
Dio...!

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:16.520
What happened...?

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:19.190
Did Dio do this...?

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.660
Can't even move a finger.

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:32.370
Is it 7 o'clock now...?

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:34.300
In Japan it must be midnight.

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:35.640
Father...

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:37.040
Mother...

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:38.330
I'm sorry...

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:40.550
It seems...my life...

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:42.280
is running out.

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:44.340
It's certainly been...

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:46.580
a short life...

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:47.610
but...

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:50.550
thanks to Jotaro and everyone...

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:53.190
I can die knowing I hadn't
given into the fear of Dio.

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:57.160
I was no match for his power, but...

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:00.930
I lived my life...as I wished!

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.400
I have no regrets.

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:03.130
But...

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:05.630
Joestar-san...I'm sorry!

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:07.110
I wasn't able to...

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:08.470
defeat Dio...

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:12.510
nor find the secret to Dio's Stand.

00:23:14.420 --> 00:23:16.040
But...why...?

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:19.850
A perfect barrier...

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.850
why was it broken all at once?

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:25.350
I'm sure I didn't...

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:26.830
miss any of his movements.

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.960
In spite of that...

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:30.760
not one part, but...

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.560
the entire barrier of twenty meters...

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:35.100
why, all at once...?

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:37.730
Without any time lag.

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:43.140
Without any time lag...!?

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:47.410
Time...

00:23:49.850 --> 00:23:51.320
That must be it...!

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:52.650
It's the only thing I can think of.

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:53.480
Time!

00:23:54.260 --> 00:23:56.320
He can stop time!

00:23:57.830 --> 00:23:59.300
I must let him know...

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:01.090
this shocking reality.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:03.100
Somehow, Joestar-san must...!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.560
At this rate, Joestar-san and...

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:07.540
Holley-san's lives will...!

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:11.940
Don't you agree, Joseph?

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:14.340
About this, Jonathan Joestar's body.

00:24:14.450 --> 00:24:19.180
For this scar to perfectly adapt to me...
I must say your blood is the best fit.

00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:24.050
Joseph Joestar...

00:24:24.160 --> 00:24:26.950
I'm letting you know that I will
kill you by sucking your blood.

00:24:29.460 --> 00:24:33.630
Before it adapts, I'll cut you in
two, right through that scar!

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:38.770
The bloodline of yours that speaks
too boldly is now coming to an end.

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:40.600
Die!

00:24:53.520 --> 00:24:54.180
A fi...

00:24:54.620 --> 00:24:55.810
final...

00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:01.020
Shooting in such a random direction...

00:25:01.130 --> 00:25:03.930
it could be the cry of his final moments.

00:25:04.030 --> 00:25:05.160
I-It can't be!

00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:08.860
Kakyoin is not a man who would do
anything meaningless at a time like this!

00:25:09.800 --> 00:25:11.830
Why that clock tower!?

00:25:12.010 --> 00:25:12.270
m...

00:25:12.910 --> 00:25:14.130
message.

00:25:15.110 --> 00:25:15.870
This is...

00:25:16.410 --> 00:25:18.110
all I can do...!

00:25:19.210 --> 00:25:20.370
Joestar-san...

00:25:22.050 --> 00:25:24.680
please...receive it...

00:25:27.120 --> 00:25:28.450
Kakyoin!

00:25:29.720 --> 00:25:30.750
Diooo!

00:25:37.130 --> 00:25:38.530
Take this!

00:25:42.500 --> 00:25:43.330
You old man!

00:25:43.440 --> 00:25:46.170
Your Stand is the lamest one!

00:25:54.950 --> 00:25:57.380
There must be some
important meaning to it!

00:25:58.420 --> 00:25:59.410
Kakyoin...

00:25:59.520 --> 00:26:02.680
what was it you wanted to tell me
by shooting the clock tower!?

00:26:03.160 --> 00:26:05.090
Destroying the clock tower...

00:26:05.190 --> 00:26:06.990
what is the meaning of it!?

00:26:09.000 --> 00:26:11.120
No use trying to escape, Joseph.

00:26:13.140 --> 00:26:15.600
Could it be...Dio's...'The World's secret!?

00:26:18.810 --> 00:26:20.670
To destroy the clock!?

00:26:21.910 --> 00:26:23.640
To stop the clock!?

00:26:29.390 --> 00:26:31.290
Stopping the clock!?

00:26:37.460 --> 00:26:38.550
I-it can't be!

00:26:38.700 --> 00:26:40.990
The World can stop time!?

00:26:41.870 --> 00:26:42.920
Now I understand...!

00:26:43.070 --> 00:26:44.230
Kakyoin!

00:26:44.870 --> 00:26:47.600
The message sent me with
the last strength of your life...

00:26:48.040 --> 00:26:50.030
I have indeed received it!

00:26:55.380 --> 00:26:56.280
What!?

00:27:05.090 --> 00:27:07.990
You are quite a schemer,
aren't you, Joseph?

00:27:11.160 --> 00:27:12.720
That goes with you, too.

00:27:14.670 --> 00:27:17.660
It was very cautious of you to
see through the Wave Energy.

00:27:18.040 --> 00:27:19.660
But now I know one thing.

00:27:20.370 --> 00:27:22.310
For you to come after us like this...

00:27:22.410 --> 00:27:25.640
it seems the length of time
you can stop is very limited!

00:27:26.210 --> 00:27:27.140
Isn't it...

00:27:27.680 --> 00:27:28.610
Dio?

00:27:29.950 --> 00:27:31.880
You figured it out.

00:27:32.850 --> 00:27:34.580
I must compliment you a little on that.

00:27:34.690 --> 00:27:36.480
The one who figured it out was Kakyoin!

00:27:36.620 --> 00:27:38.520
I won't let Kakyoin die in vain!

00:27:38.760 --> 00:27:40.190
So, what does it matter!?

00:27:40.330 --> 00:27:42.950
You figured it out, but what do
you think you can do about it!?

00:27:43.100 --> 00:27:45.890
Your Wave Energy means nothing to me.

00:28:16.660 --> 00:28:17.220
Jo...

00:28:17.830 --> 00:28:19.160
Jotaro!

00:28:21.640 --> 00:28:22.760
Old man...!

00:28:23.840 --> 00:28:24.530
Jotaro!

00:28:24.670 --> 00:28:26.040
Back off! Don't come near!

00:28:26.810 --> 00:28:29.940
Jotaro!? Just as I
suspected, he was still alive.

00:28:30.080 --> 00:28:32.010
But, he is out of my range.

00:28:33.410 --> 00:28:34.680
I'll deal with Joseph first!

00:28:35.250 --> 00:28:36.080
Jotaro!

00:28:36.220 --> 00:28:38.410
The true nature of 'The World' is time!

00:28:39.620 --> 00:28:41.280
That Stand can stop time!

00:28:55.140 --> 00:28:58.600
In the beginning, my power was
able to stop only a blink of time.

00:28:58.740 --> 00:28:59.370
But...

00:29:00.010 --> 00:29:01.770
as this scar on the neck faded...

00:29:02.110 --> 00:29:03.310
the timeframe gradually became longer.

00:29:03.450 --> 00:29:05.740
Now I can stop at least five seconds.

00:29:07.620 --> 00:29:09.680
Soon, I will be able to...

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:12.750
stop time as long as I wish!

00:29:20.960 --> 00:29:23.760
Guarding yourself with Wave Energy
won't do you any good, Joseph.

00:29:24.700 --> 00:29:25.690
A hundred years ago...

00:29:25.800 --> 00:29:27.900
Wave Energy was bit of a problem for me.

00:29:28.040 --> 00:29:30.270
But in the presence of 'The World...'

00:29:30.370 --> 00:29:31.900
Useless, useless, useless, useless, useless!

00:29:33.180 --> 00:29:35.170
Jonathan's grandson, Joseph.

00:29:36.550 --> 00:29:38.540
With that, you have died.

00:29:43.090 --> 00:29:44.780
Three seconds!

00:29:45.590 --> 00:29:46.490
Two.

00:29:47.090 --> 00:29:47.890
One.

00:29:48.730 --> 00:29:49.250
Zero.

00:30:01.970 --> 00:30:03.070
Old man...!

00:30:08.250 --> 00:30:08.800
Jo...

00:30:08.910 --> 00:30:10.040
Jotaro...

00:30:10.420 --> 00:30:12.850
Don't...go near him!

00:30:13.250 --> 00:30:14.950
Keep...a distance...

00:30:15.620 --> 00:30:17.820
N-no comparison...!

00:30:23.760 --> 00:30:26.860
That guy, Kakyoin...I've
already finished him.

00:30:28.940 --> 00:30:30.130
Jotaro...

00:30:30.240 --> 00:30:31.400
you're the last one.

00:30:35.740 --> 00:30:37.400
You bastard...

00:30:37.510 --> 00:30:38.340
Dio!

00:30:42.250 --> 00:30:44.770
Oh! Are you coming for me?

00:30:45.750 --> 00:30:47.690
Your grandfather Joseph's last words...

00:30:47.790 --> 00:30:49.880
are you ignoring them and approaching...

00:30:49.990 --> 00:30:51.220
me, Dio!?

00:30:52.030 --> 00:30:53.690
If I don't get closer...

00:30:53.830 --> 00:30:55.560
I can't beat the crap out of...

00:30:56.400 --> 00:30:57.590
YOU!
